WEBVTT

00:01:31.708 --> 00:01:34.292
(Rustling)

00:01:39.792 --> 00:01:41.792
(Sniffing)

00:01:41.917 --> 00:01:43.417
Oh...

00:01:49.583 --> 00:01:52.583
(Sniffing)

00:01:53.417 --> 00:01:54.917
Hmm...

00:02:14.625 --> 00:02:15.625
Whoa.

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:16.750
(Gasps)

00:02:16.875 --> 00:02:17.875
Oh...

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:20.542
(Grunting)

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:26.917
(Screaming)

00:03:11.542 --> 00:03:13.625
Wherever did you come from?

00:03:16.458 --> 00:03:19.708
Well, you're here now.

00:03:19.833 --> 00:03:22.125
- (Burps)
- (Chuckles)

00:03:22.708 --> 00:03:28.792
And remember, little one,
if you ever get lost again,

00:03:28.917 --> 00:03:32.958
just roar and I'll roar right back.

00:03:34.292 --> 00:03:36.375
(Roaring)

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:38.167
That's right.

00:03:38.292 --> 00:03:41.458
(Roaring)

00:03:43.458 --> 00:03:47.458
I'll hear you
however far away you are.

00:04:19.708 --> 00:04:21.125
Hmm.

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:32.333
Hmm? Huh.

00:04:32.458 --> 00:04:33.958
Er...

00:04:39.208 --> 00:04:40.500
(Photo booth jingles)

00:04:40.625 --> 00:04:42.458
'Thank you for using Photo-Me.'

00:04:42.583 --> 00:04:45.250
Oh, not at all.
Thank you for having me.

00:04:45.375 --> 00:04:48.125
'Please note that head wear
is not permitted.'

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:51.083
Oh, beg your pardon.

00:04:51.208 --> 00:04:54.125
'Please note that head wear
is not permitted.'

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:55.583
Um...

00:04:55.708 --> 00:04:57.708
Ha. Hmm.

00:05:00.667 --> 00:05:04.292
'Please position your face
within the red circle.'

00:05:04.417 --> 00:05:06.500
Red circle, right, um...

00:05:06.625 --> 00:05:10.292
'Commencing photos
in three, two, one...'

00:05:10.417 --> 00:05:11.833
(Mumbles)

00:05:11.958 --> 00:05:13.375
(Camera shutter clicks)

00:05:15.667 --> 00:05:19.292
- Oh, no! Wait!
- (Camera shutter clicks repeatedly)

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:30.333
Oh, no... no, no, no, no!
These aren't mine.

00:05:30.458 --> 00:05:36.333
'You have paid for 12... 24...
48 photos.'

00:05:36.458 --> 00:05:38.583
Mm-hmm.

00:05:41.708 --> 00:05:45.000
Thank you. Keep the change!

00:05:48.208 --> 00:05:50.708
- Hmm... Huh?
- (Cooing)

00:05:52.458 --> 00:05:55.000
(Paddington) 'Dear Aunt Lucy,

00:05:55.125 --> 00:05:59.875
'I am writing to you
with some very important news!'

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.333
- It's arrived!
- Special delivery.

00:06:02.458 --> 00:06:05.417
(Gasps) Thank you.

00:06:09.625 --> 00:06:12.208
How wonderful.

00:06:12.333 --> 00:06:14.333
Your very own passport.

00:06:14.458 --> 00:06:18.500
So now you can
"Pass Freely Without Let Or Hindrance".

00:06:18.625 --> 00:06:22.208
'Aunt Lucy, I am now "Officially British"!'

00:06:22.333 --> 00:06:24.583
- And we all chipped in to buy you a gift.
- Oh?

00:06:24.708 --> 00:06:28.500
Well, Paddington, no British gentleman
should be without an umbrella.

00:06:28.625 --> 00:06:30.792
And not just any brolly.

00:06:30.917 --> 00:06:34.167
The Windsorman Deluxe,
London's finest!

00:06:34.292 --> 00:06:36.958
Oh! Thank you very much.

00:06:38.625 --> 00:06:39.667
(All gasp)

00:06:41.333 --> 00:06:43.833
Goodness, that's quite an umbrella.

00:06:43.958 --> 00:06:44.792
(Thunder rumbling)

00:06:44.917 --> 00:06:48.833
- Oh, bottoms!
- London! There you go.

00:06:48.958 --> 00:06:52.125
(Paddington) 'There have been a few
other changes at Windsor Gardens

00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:54.083
'since you were last here.

00:06:54.208 --> 00:07:00.250
'Judy is applying to university,
a process known as "flying the nest".

00:07:02.542 --> 00:07:04.375
'Mrs Brown is helping.

